India AI Reliability Lab
Most organizations have proven they can build AI. The bigger challenge is governing AI, controlling token costs, and operating AI reliably at scale.

This repository explain about how one can 
- Improving AI governance and reducing operational risk
- Optimizing token consumption and lowering AI costs
- Understand LLM as a Judge
- Scaling AI adoption with confidence and reliability

You'll hear practical lessons from organizations that have successfully moved AI from experimentation to production while balancing innovation, governance, and cost efficiency.


During the lab, your practitioners team will learn how to:

- Improve AI output quality and reduce hallucinations
- Detect and optimize token waste to control LLM costs
- Gain visibility into complex Agentic AI workflows
- Identify and resolve AI latency and performance issues
- Monitor and scale cloud-native AI and Kubernetes environments with confidence
- Executive Session
